  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries.\n• Place on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with dried oregano. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59e3/step-401cde00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, thinly slice zucchini into strips lengthways.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59e3/step-3bd35110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook zucchini, turning until tender, 2-4 minutes each side. Transfer to a bowl, season with salt and pepper and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59e3/step-c87bad20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook plant-based burger patties until browned and heated through, 2-3 minutes each side. TIP: For even browning, gently press down on the patties using a spatula.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59e3/step-7d86f330.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes.\n• In a second medium bowl, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Toss to coat and season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59e3/step-f61a4d40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread burger buns with dill & parsley mayonnaise. Top with charred zucchini, plant-based burger patty and some salad.\n• Divide Greek-style plant-based burgers and fries between plates. Serve with remaining salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59e3/step-58691c50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
